<Base title="Field Programmer"><section class="app-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">ANDROID RADIO PROGRAMMING</p><h1>Your radio.<br/><em>Your channels.</em><br/>Anywhere.</h1><p>Field Programmer lets you configure supported handheld radios from Android without accounts, bloat, or an internet connection.</p><a class="button" href="#radios">View supported radios</a></div><div class="fp-badge"><span>FP</span><b>FIELD<br/>PROGRAMMER</b><small>BY KA0MED</small></div></section><section class="section"><div class="feature-grid"><div><b>01</b><h3>Offline by design</h3><p>Your channel plans and radio data stay on your device.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Built for the field</h3><p>A focused mobile workflow when carrying a laptop makes no sense.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Growing radio support</h3><p>Drivers are tested against real radios and expanded continuously.</p></div></div><div id="radios" class="supported"><p class="eyebrow">SUPPORTED RADIO FAMILIES</p><h2>Built around radios operators actually carry.</h2><div class="chips"><span>UV-5R Family</span><span>UV-5R Mini</span><span>UV-5G Mini</span><span>UV-32</span><span>AR-152</span></div></div></section></Base>
